' M16 R48 TOKEN/ABI PROBE ONLY, NOT THE REAL CAPTURE FUNCTION.
' Run only with the R48 DIAGNOSTIC .Lib in an isolated WinUAE config.
' The diagnostic must NEVER create any bank or open any screen.
' Use Project -> Merge ASCII in an empty AMOS program.
Cls
Print "R48 TOKEN/ABI PROBE"
Print "BEFORE R48 CALL"
_OK=Aga Image Capture(11,16,16,16,16,-1)
Print "AFTER R48 CALL ";_OK
Print "RESULT ";_OK
End
